Build environment requirements:
- 32 bits x86 C compiler
- ancient Ruby, statically linkable

I choose to use an old Debian Jessie chroot:
  debootstrap --no-check-sig --arch=i386 jessie /srv/jessie-i386  http://archive.debian.org/debian
  chroot /srv/jessie-i386/

  apt-get install build-essential pkg-config ruby2.1-dev
